          "disabled": false,
          "hit": true,
          "font": "20px",
          "focus": true
        },
        {
          "text": "3\n        \n        \n          Forge a Keepsake\n          The flame strengthens a Keepsake. Its price is some of your maximum Courage.\n          Costs 8 maximum Courage\n          Courage 74 \u2192 66 \u00b7 the Keepsake fires twice\n        ",
          "disabled": false,
          "hit": true,
          "font": "20px",
          "focus": true
        },
        {
          "text": "4\n        \n        \n          Sit with your Companion\n          Share a quiet moment and see what catches their attention.\n          +1 Clue\n          Spend your fort action to gain a Clue.\n        ",
          "disabled": false,
